wotc_new: PROC /lab_data/behrmannlab/claire/sym_pt_rerun; masks and CSVs to /user_data/csimmon2/git_repos/sym_pt/sandbox/rerun_extract/wotc_new
60 subjects (36 control, 24 OTC)

SPLIT-HALF: 60/60 subjects have >=2 run-level cope maps (median 33).
  Running WITHOUT a split. The RSM diagonal is therefore 1.0 by
  construction and is not reported; only the 6 off-diagonal entries
  are used. Group comparisons stay valid; absolute values are not
  comparable to Rosenke's split-half numbers.

96 subject x hemisphere odRSMs   (mean 11440 voxels)

